{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e926f10c41a7a10aecdab8f407278fa18e6d26e3393cc0f9762e5770db6c9e1a", "ja": "（新作ファンタジードラマの撮影が終わった。\nあとは、アフレコを残すだけだ……）", "zh": "（新的奇幻电视剧结束拍摄了。\n接着只剩下后制录音……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "75d470e01ae60672da1223842ff1a8f206f9dc258a79e050726cad60df1a6ae0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おつかれさま！\nどうだった？　わたし、ちゃんとできてた？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n怎么样？我表现得好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "43585964e2e5ea86ab24e6ac90017ce6e3d678ee3c41035b8fbe9478fac8125f", "ja": "お疲れさま、育。うん、良かったよ。\nとくに最後のシーンは、迫真の演技だったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，育。嗯，你表现得很棒喔～\n尤其是最后一幕，演技非常逼真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "c68bc546cd82e641f4ab973c951e6f6d3455f1cb232ee9384cadb357c05baed8", "ja": "あそこは、桃子ちゃんと話して決めたんだよ。\nカッコよくできてたならよかった～！", "zh": "那是我跟桃子讨论后才决定要那样演的。\n有演得很帅气就好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "345ed622dbeb9f0238a9c4c245d283ae008a6ec999e9cb87b68126178cc731af", "ja": "えへへ、でき上がりがすっごく楽しみ！\n女神さまの召喚シーン、早く見てみたいな～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，好期待成品喔！\n真想赶快看到女神的召唤片段～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e04f6cb7de7d891186f0399a7d6271e85be12ac7330aadb5022c52fd8c461d01", "ja": "あのシーンはCGで作るはずだから、\nきっとカッコいい演出になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "那一幕应该是用CG制作，\n所以肯定会有很帅气的演出效果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ef2d4575eb3a1d87525906db5922702fad1e9e687d46770653b702ef95b896a0", "ja": "さて、次はゴーレムのアフレコだけど……\n育、まだ元気はあるか？", "zh": "好了，接下来要进行魔像的后制录音……\n育，你还有精神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "870a273f48ad2604a9545a864b5e91513bca10f926cae8d3edfc15063debc656", "ja": "うん！　わたし、まだまだ平気だよ！\nそれに、アフレコのお仕事するの、楽しみだったんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！我还一点都不累！\n而且，其实我很期待后制录音的工作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "91e25244b16367e378baf9643284a3c988f7af4cf9101e304e3f61f44ad36e5b", "ja": "声優さんみたいで、なんだかドキドキするね！\nシャイドルの声優さんに会えたりして……えへへ♪", "zh": "感觉好像配音员，让人有点兴奋呢！\n搞不好还会遇到闪偶的配音员……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8272304dc3ccfe416888bef9c52c546efb4f3b7f5c3f8526a0fb7cde2175acb2", "ja": "そうだな、同じスタジオを使っていたら会えるかもな。\nでも、まずは仕事が優先で頼むぞ！", "zh": "这个嘛，如果是用同一间录音室，或许会遇到吧。\n不过，要拜托你先把工作摆在第一喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "d3010ac37b314102ff850f158d4aac443ea8675ab7f2797d29199c603c4c5fe5", "ja": "大丈夫！　プロはお仕事が第一って、\n桃子ちゃんも言ってたもん。", "zh": "放心！专业人士会把工作摆在第一，\n桃子也这么说过嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "2484d6ec94cfbae9578b09a807a4565e32c56a18607b322c74319b018bcc07c8", "ja": "わたしは桃子ちゃんを守るゴーレムだから、\n声もカッコよくしないと……あっ。", "zh": "我是保护桃子的魔像，\n所以声音也要配得够帅气才行……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "f096c039aa248797e29d753aaf976f6318308597dadc7f100a0f39293ff4825e", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。\nゴーレムって、どんな感じで演技すればいいのかな？", "zh": "问你喔，{$P$}先生。\n魔像要用怎样的感觉去诠释才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a781743f5901e672fa290403643e76424b6eadfcc22bca77b02fe54c99350a86", "ja": "さっき、女神さまの撮影をした時みたいな感じで\nいいと思うけど……何か気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "我觉得用刚才拍摄女神时的感觉就可以了……\n你有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "729830909b2132eec6dd41e54c04b3f4ae327d8556affa9812dd672e9ad8847c", "ja": "うん……。だって、ゴーレムとわたしって、\n見た目が全然ちがうし……。", "zh": "嗯……毕竟魔像跟我，\n外表完全不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "31bf823ad839e357eb9ca7b963f3054c302fcb7b61014993a31ecb01e2f1ed85", "ja": "わたしに、ゴーレムの声なんて出せるのかなぁ？\nあんなに大きくて強そうなのに……。", "zh": "我有办法配出魔像的声音吗？\n它看起来那么巨大强壮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "12744a480d20334d4f173f28b85ac1d23be2b42c09f42ad38ddbbee1e521ddff", "ja": "むんっ！　やぁー！　たぁー！　とぉー！\n……どう？　強そうに聞こえる？", "zh": "唔！喝──！哈──！嘿──！\n……如何？听起来有很强吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8839443fca74ecd40d45499f49c62be856b2df310e04c89ef759b5541603c8f0", "ja": "うーん、強そうな感じはしないけど……。\nけど、別に強そうな必要はないんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯～是没有很强的感觉……\n不过，也没有一定要很强吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "808b7dca9298b7576354bfde52a2f8a6c9512ddc1ca01985de9acfcfe4407a3e", "ja": "ゴーレムは、さっき育が演じた女神さまでもあるから。\n女神さまのままでいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "因为魔像同时也是育刚才扮演的女神，\n所以维持女神的感觉应该就可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "af0ee2c311a9a6ea461fa273619be9d93f1b3bad14b5abb6680b30c3e550ab86", "ja": "女神さまのわたし……えっと、みんなを守るために\n桃子ちゃんに召喚された、大地の女神さま……。", "zh": "身为女神的我……呃……\n是桃子为了保护大家而召唤出来的大地女神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "03ef18621fdebdb5e80d41035ed9e0f057928a8868347e4ca84170fbc3fe9ea6", "ja": "うん！　ちょっとだけ、イメージできたかも！\nありがとう、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "嗯！我好像有点抓到感觉了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ce0ef6310fdadf40bf87b5aa6c0508a5d3cbbd0b8f04c45477e716040ba17f33", "ja": "（育のイメージは無事に受け入れられて、\nあっという間に収録は終わった）", "zh": "（育的诠释顺利获得认可，\n录音一下子就结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0154_1022_p", "source_sha256": "aecdcc8c289b091352e3b3fb216afcac2cac0f811ad2326b5a3b32eaf3a52731", "ja": "（ドラマでは、きっと仲睦まじい育と桃子が\n見られるだろう。今から完成が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（在电视剧里肯定可以看到育跟桃子\n亲密无间的模样吧，我现在就好期待成品！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
